[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Manticore Search 14 (searchd):

- the config: %%PREFIX%%/etc/manticore.conf (a copy of manticore.conf.sample:
  RT mode, on 127.0.0.1 only; data /var/db/manticore);
- the service: sysrc manticore_enable=YES; service manticore start
  (several searchd: manticore_profiles="a b", one config each,
  %%PREFIX%%/etc/manticore-a.conf ...);
- the columnar storage, secondary indexes and vector search (KNN, auto
  embeddings): pkg install manticore14-columnar;
- Buddy (fuzzy search, autocomplete, SHOW QUERIES and more) is not packaged:
  searchd logs "[BUDDY] ... disabled" and works without it.
EOM
}
]
